      <title>学厨之鱼香肉丝做法</title>
      <link href="/post/d4880515.html"/>
      <url>/post/d4880515.html</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="note info flat"><p>文章参考链接：<a href="http://www.meishij.net/chufang/diy/sijiacai/1921565.html">美食杰之鱼香肉丝</a></p></div><h1 id="营养和功效"><a href="#营养和功效" class="headerlink" title="营养和功效"></a>营养和功效</h1><p><code>鱼香肉丝</code>是很多人喜欢吃的一道菜，是一道经典的汉族传统名菜，鱼香是川菜主要传统味型之一，鱼香肉丝以鱼香调味而定名，它的营养成分，主要来自于它的配料很多：</p><ul><li><code>猪肉</code>:猪肉含有丰富的优质蛋白质和必需的脂肪酸,并提供血红素(有机铁)和促进铁吸收的半胱氨酸,能改善缺铁性贫血;具有补肾养血,滋阴润燥的功效;里脊肉含有丰富的优质蛋白,脂肪、胆固醇含量相对较少,一般人群都可食用。</li><li><code>木耳</code>:黑木耳中铁的含量极为丰富,故常吃木耳能养血驻颜,令人肌肤红润,容光焕发,并可防治缺铁性贫血;黑木耳含有维生素K,能减少血液凝块,预防血栓症的发生,有防治动脉粥样硬化和冠心病的作用。</li><li><code>胡萝卜</code>:胡萝卜中含有降糖物质，是糖尿病人的良好食品，胡萝卜中含有琥珀酸钾盐，有助于防止血管硬化，降低胆固醇及有降低血压的作用，胡萝卜中的叶酸能减少冠心病发病因素，还具有强心的作用，胡萝卜的热量比较低，是减肥人群的良好食品，胡萝卜具有健脾消食、润肠通便、杀虫、行气、化滞、补肝明目、清热解毒等功效。</li><li><code>青椒</code>青椒一般可以解热镇痛、缓解肌肉酸疼等。青椒富含水分、维生素A、维生素C、胡萝卜素及碳水化合物等营养成分，青辣椒很辣，能出汗、祛湿、散寒。还能刺激味觉，增进食欲。青辣椒中的辣椒素和维生素C是抗氧化物质，不仅能促进脂肪分解，降低脂肪和体重。还能防止癌细胞癌变和扩散，防止癌症的发生。</li></ul><h1 id="用料"><a href="#用料" class="headerlink" title="用料"></a>用料</h1><div class="btns grid5">            <a href='https://fc1tn.baidu.com/it/u=340580812,3168565257&fm=202&src=780&crossm&mola=new&crop=v1'>  <img src='https://fc1tn.baidu.com/it/u=340580812,3168565257&fm=202&src=780&crossm&mola=new&crop=v1' style="height:90px !important;width:90px !important">  <b>猪肉 300克</b></a><a href='https://t15.baidu.com/it/u=3071398567,2979299315&fm=224&app=112&size=h200&n=0&f=PNG?sec=1661706000&t=5f6fc1f052c724ad86c9944d2018e6ad'>  <img src='https://t15.baidu.com/it/u=3071398567,2979299315&fm=224&app=112&size=h200&n=0&f=PNG?sec=1661706000&t=5f6fc1f052c724ad86c9944d2018e6ad' style="height:90px !important;width:90px !important">  <b>蒜 10克</b></a><a href='https://t13.baidu.com/it/u=1392814843,1300763627&fm=224&app=112&size=h200&n=0&f=JPEG&fmt=auto?sec=1661706000&t=e0caa6dab6f2398ea62c7794a2754542'>  <img src='https://t13.baidu.com/it/u=1392814843,1300763627&fm=224&app=112&size=h200&n=0&f=JPEG&fmt=auto?sec=1661706000&t=e0caa6dab6f2398ea62c7794a2754542' style="height:90px !important;width:90px !important">  <b>青椒 30克</b></a><a href='https://t15.baidu.com/it/u=1009140455,3392517624&fm=58&s=716A6EF8A44A5F47628620790300705B'>  <img src='https://t15.baidu.com/it/u=1009140455,3392517624&fm=58&s=716A6EF8A44A5F47628620790300705B' style="height:90px !important;width:90px !important">  <b>胡萝卜 30克</b></a><a href='https://img0.baidu.com/it/u=3670952111,3102718478&fm=253&app=120&size=w931&n=0&f=JPEG&fmt=auto?sec=1661706000&t=d3965839c0f7ccc39f020266a9bdb363'>  <img src='https://img0.baidu.com/it/u=3670952111,3102718478&fm=253&app=120&size=w931&n=0&f=JPEG&fmt=auto?sec=1661706000&t=d3965839c0f7ccc39f020266a9bdb363' style="height:90px !important;width:90px !important">  <b>木耳 30克</b></a><a href='http://images.meishij.net/p/20111101/7a9b6f21b05c70688efabe0b91c975f2_60x60.jpg'>  <img src='http://images.meishij.net/p/20111101/7a9b6f21b05c70688efabe0b91c975f2_60x60.jpg' style="height:90px !important;width:90px !important">  <b>红辣椒 10克</b></a><a href='http://site.meishij.net/shicaiimg/103/shicai1353_60x60.jpg'>  <img src='http://site.meishij.net/shicaiimg/103/shicai1353_60x60.jpg' style="height:90px !important;width:90px !important">  <b>油 1勺</b></a><a href='http://images.meishij.net/p/20161024/f62391a4cfa6970b0352c2170ea6ae95_60x60.jpg'>  <img src='http://images.meishij.net/p/20161024/f62391a4cfa6970b0352c2170ea6ae95_60x60.jpg' style="height:90px !important;width:90px !important">  <b>豆瓣酱 2勺</b></a><a href='https://img2.baidu.com/it/u=3256376213,514383213&fm=253&app=138&size=w931&n=0&f=JPEG&fmt=auto?sec=1661706000&t=68afff5751e6f747e4725bb229819aab'>  <img src='https://img2.baidu.com/it/u=3256376213,514383213&fm=253&app=138&size=w931&n=0&f=JPEG&fmt=auto?sec=1661706000&t=68afff5751e6f747e4725bb229819aab' style="height:90px !important;width:90px !important">  <b>葱 10克</b></a><a href='http://images.meishij.net/p/20111214/f8c7dfc3756fa9bd82f4559f6eeb39ce_60x60.jpg'>  <img src='http://images.meishij.net/p/20111214/f8c7dfc3756fa9bd82f4559f6eeb39ce_60x60.jpg' style="height:90px !important;width:90px !important">  <b>姜 5克</b></a>          </div><ul><li>辅料：盐、糖、醋、耗油、酱油、味精、蛋清、淀粉、料酒</li></ul><h1 id="做法"><a href="#做法" class="headerlink" title="做法"></a>做法</h1><div class="img-wrap"><div class="img-bg"><img class="img" src="https://st-cn.meishij.net/rs/06/129/5469756/n5469756_155230498907093.jpg"/></div></div><p style= "text-align:center">1、准备一块新鲜的猪肉洗净沥干水分切成细丝</p><div class="img-wrap"><div class="img-bg"><img class="img" src="https://st-cn.meishij.net/rs/06/129/5469756/n5469756_155230498994918.jpg"/></div></div><p style= "text-align:center">2、肉丝放入容器中打入一个蛋清再放入料酒、淀粉</p><div class="img-wrap"><div class="img-bg"><img class="img" src="https://st-cn.meishij.net/rs/06/129/5469756/n5469756_155230498905562.jpg"/></div></div><p style= "text-align:center">3、肉丝和调料抓匀煨制十分钟</p><div class="img-wrap"><div class="img-bg"><img class="img" src="https://st-cn.meishij.net/rs/06/129/5469756/n5469756_155230498879848.jpg"/></div></div><p style= "text-align:center">4、葱姜蒜切成小粒备用</p><div class="img-wrap"><div class="img-bg"><img class="img" src="https://st-cn.meishij.net/rs/06/129/5469756/n5469756_155230498904059.jpg"/></div></div><p style= "text-align:center">5、准备配料胡萝卜、青椒、木耳、红辣椒切成丝</p><div class="img-wrap"><div class="img-bg"><img class="img" src="https://st-cn.meishij.net/rs/06/129/5469756/n5469756_155230499050735.jpg"/></div></div><p style= "text-align:center">6、准备调味料蚝油、一品鲜酱油、糖、醋、盐、味精添加适量清水搅拌均匀</p><div class="img-wrap"><div class="img-bg"><img class="img" src="https://st-cn.meishij.net/rs/06/129/5469756/n5469756_155230499086978.jpg"/></div></div><p style= "text-align:center">7、锅中倒入适量底油加热放入葱姜蒜爆香</p><div class="img-wrap"><div class="img-bg"><img class="img" src="https://st-cn.meishij.net/rs/06/129/5469756/n5469756_155230499047886.jpg"/></div></div><p style= "text-align:center">8、倒入煨制好的肉丝翻炒</p><div class="img-wrap"><div class="img-bg"><img class="img" src="https://st-cn.meishij.net/rs/06/129/5469756/n5469756_155230499060327.jpg"/></div></div><p style= "text-align:center">9、肉丝微微变色放入郫县豆瓣酱</p><div class="img-wrap"><div class="img-bg"><img class="img" src="https://st-cn.meishij.net/rs/06/129/5469756/n5469756_155230499154328.jpg"/></div></div><p style= "text-align:center">10、将郫县豆瓣酱和肉丝炒匀</p><div class="img-wrap"><div class="img-bg"><img class="img" src="https://st-cn.meishij.net/rs/06/129/5469756/n5469756_155230499171006.jpg"/></div></div><p style= "text-align:center">11、放入配料胡萝卜、青椒、木耳丝大火快速翻炒</p><div class="img-wrap"><div class="img-bg"><img class="img" src="https://st-cn.meishij.net/rs/06/129/5469756/n5469756_155230499177004.jpg"/></div></div><p style= "text-align:center">12、最后倒入调味料汁大火开始翻炒均匀入味</p><div class="img-wrap"><div class="img-bg"><img class="img" src="https://st-cn.meishij.net/rs/06/129/5469756/n5469756_155230499182200.jpg"/></div></div><p style= "text-align:center">13、准备调味料蚝油、一品鲜酱油、糖、醋、盐、味精添加适量清水搅拌均匀</p><div class="img-wrap"><div class="img-bg"><img class="img" src="https://st-cn.meishij.net/rs/06/129/5469756/n5469756_155230499171230.jpg"/></div></div><p style= "text-align:center">14、最后撒上红辣椒丝简单翻炒一下即可出锅享用</p><h1 id="相关视频"><a href="#相关视频" class="headerlink" title="相关视频"></a>相关视频</h1><iframe src="//player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=895039062&bvid=BV16P4y1T7QN&cid=556793430&page=1&as_wide=1&high_quality=1" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true"  align="middle" style="width: 1000px; height: 600px; max-width: 100%" > </iframe>]]></content>
      
      
